From: OpenWrt RTL8197F bringup <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: add read-only RTL8197F CPU strap clock

Wire up the common-clock implementation supplied by the target overlay.
Only device trees explicitly using the new compatible select this provider.

--- a/drivers/clk/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/clk/Kconfig
@@ -34,0 +35,9 @@
+
+config COMMON_CLK_RTL8197F
+	bool "Realtek RTL8197F CPU strap clock"
+	depends on OF
+	depends on MACH_REALTEK_RTL || COMPILE_TEST
+	help
+	  Read the RTL8197F startup strap to expose the configured CPU rate.
+	  This does not change the CPU frequency or program a PLL.
+	  Used by experimental Cudy RTL8197F RAM-boot profiles.
--- a/drivers/clk/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/clk/Makefile
@@ -20,2 +20,3 @@
 # hardware specific clock types
+obj-$(CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_RTL8197F) += clk-rtl8197f.o
 # please keep this section sorted lexicographically by file path name
